  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "According to question,\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/PnfORxYZ6NuNwfD7jzpHvOI_MDyENgO28V3fdQmzN2o.original.fullsize.png\"/>\nDiameter $=R$\nDiagonals, $d_1=d_2=R$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n\\text { Max Area of rectangle (any quadrilateral) } & =\\frac{1}{2} d_1 \\times d_2 \\\\\n= & \\frac{1}{2} \\times R \\times R=\\frac{R^2}{2}\n\\end{aligned}$",
